            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "EAOddo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a truly *delicious* cocktail. I highly recommend using a good Pear Brandy though. A cheaper brand will have a \"fake\" pear flavor. I used Clear Creek Pear Brandy -- super smooth. I served with a cheese/bread/fruit platter and every last drop was enjoyed.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-23T09:58:37.557Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
