            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lorem Ipsum"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great cocktail. For these, I usually make individual servings of simple syrup: a 1/2 teaspoon or so of sugar in each glass plus a tablespoon of warm/hot water, stirred until the sugar dissolves.",
            "datePublished": "2009-10-13T10:05:24.210Z"
